Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:36.11,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur8}dangan no ame ni utare ni yuku no ka
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.11,0:22:42.03,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur8}shoushisenban! kuni no tame da!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.29,0:22:45.89,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur8}senjou e! zensen e! soshite shi no fuchi made!
